  <question type="multichoice">
    <name><text>GG-S21-ECON-Q03</text></name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><span lang="en" class="multilang">Consider the following statements regarding the Koneru Ranga Rao Committee:
1. It was appointed primarily to recommend strategies for attracting foreign direct investment (FDI) in AP's agricultural sector.
2. It strongly recommended the strict enforcement of the AP Assigned Lands (Prohibition of Transfers) Act, 1977.
3. It highlighted the need to effectively implement the 1/70 Act to protect tribal lands in scheduled areas.
Which of the statements given above are correct?</span></p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.25</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>ABCD</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<span lang="en" class="multilang">1 and 2 only</span>]]></text>
      <feedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<span lang="en" class="multilang">Incorrect.</span>]]></text></feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<span lang="en" class="multilang">2 and 3 only</span>]]></text>
      <feedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<span lang="en" class="multilang">Correct! The Koneru Ranga Rao Committee was appointed to look into issues related to land distribution to the poor, assigned lands, and tribal land rights, NOT for attracting FDI in agriculture. Hence, statement 1 is incorrect. Statements 2 and 3 accurately reflect its major recommendations.</span>]]></text></feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<span lang="en" class="multilang">1 and 3 only</span>]]></text>
      <feedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<span lang="en" class="multilang">Incorrect.</span>]]></text></feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<span lang="en" class="multilang">1, 2 and 3</span>]]></text>
      <feedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<span lang="en" class="multilang">Incorrect.</span>]]></text></feedback>
    </answer>
    <tags>
      <tag><text>micro_topic_id:MT-ECON-M4-7-006</text></tag>
      <tag><text>subject:Economy</text></tag>
